{
  "_comment": [
    "Canonical geometry for the Iterable webinar template.",
    "Every other file in this project is derived from these numbers:",
    "  ../build-template.jsx  (CFG block, values as 0-1 RGB floats)",
    "  ../layout-spec.html    (design review mock)",
    "  iterable-webinar-4x5.svg / iterable-webinar-9x16.svg",
    "  plugin/code.js         (LAYOUT const)",
    "If you change a value here, change it in all of them. There is no",
    "build step wiring these together - it is a five-file design kit and",
    "a toolchain would cost more than it saves."
  ],

